##SpliceAI_pred_DP_AL=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta position (bp) for acceptor loss: position (relative to variant) of max AL change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_DG=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta position (bp) for donor gain: position (relative to variant) of max DG change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DP_DL=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta position (bp) for donor loss: position (relative to variant) of max DL change (+ downstream, − upstream).
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_AG=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta score (0–1) for acceptor gain: max inc. in predicted acceptor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_AL=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta score (0–1) for acceptor loss: max dec. in predicted acceptor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_DG=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta score (0–1) for donor gain: max inc. in predicted donor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
##SpliceAI_pred_DS_DL=SpliceAI (v1.3) delta score (0–1) for donor loss: max dec. in predicted donor probability within ±50 bp. Guide cutoffs: <0.01 none; ≥0.2 high-recall; ≥0.5 recommended; ≥0.8 high-precision.
